                                "sense_id": "d5abf36b-3fe1-3163-ac16-33b97ea690b9",
                                "text": "Her still small smile teased him and her grey eyes looked at him friendlily from under the slight droop of her lids."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "203a1ff5-19d6-4a8e-9aba-9deb48bddca4",
                                "sense_id": "d5abf36b-3fe1-3163-ac16-33b97ea690b9",
                                "text": "Friendlily, because he felt well-disposed toward the world —his setting had been at D –he patted her bare, pale shoulder."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
